    <MetadataItem type="processingStep" name="baselineDerivation" value="Baselines are derived from the bottom edge of each detected axis-aligned line box, not measured from ink. The detector (htr/segmentation, Florence-2 &lt;OD&gt;) emits rectangles, not polygons or baselines." />
